// Found by the FeasibleTargetsAreReachableWithSpilling property test: a single spilled value
// (phi2, absent from the stack) and a pushable literal are demanded while the stack also has
// to shrink by one. Reloading phi2 to the top makes it surplus (spilled => minCount 0), so
// shrinking pops it again.
